'''Cambodia''' is the 5th stage in [[Empire of Cats]]. Upon completion in Chapter 1, [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] and [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja Cat]] will be available to unlock from the [[Upgrade Menu]].

