==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6~10 seconds<sup>180f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 10~26.67 seconds<sup>300f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Begin the battle by spawning a [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]], then spam [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Cats]]. When Those Guys are approaching your cats, fire the [[Cat Cannon]]. Slowly upgrade your [[Worker Cat]] to level 3, then spam [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cats]].

